# Wave T26 (Copperton kit): coproof — Copperton's own roof
# kind. Warm-grey CUT-STONE roof slabs with COPPER seams: two
# wide ashlar courses per tile, offset vertical joints, a
# bright copper flashing line along each course foot, and
# verdigris speckle at the joints. KIT_VARIANTS rustboro roof
# tones as fixed art (only Copperton wears this kind).
# Structurally wide-slab + metal seam, not a recolour:
# Meadowbrook wears small staggered sage shingles, Eldergrove
# banded thatch, Rootlet flat cedar shingle; these slabs read
# as quarry stone at screenshot scale. (NO-SAME-KIT law.)
